KernelUUPS_Test
├── when authorizeUpgrade is called by EntryPoint
│   └── it should not revert
├── when authorizeUpgrade is called by self
│   └── it should not revert
├── when authorizeUpgrade is called by unauthorized caller
│   └── it should revert with Unauthorized
├── when initialize is called for the first time with valid packages
│   └── it should initialize the kernel and install root
├── when initialize is called a second time
│   └── it should revert with InvalidInitialization
├── when initialize is called with empty packages
│   └── it should revert with InvalidInitialization
├── when initialize is called with multiple packages
│   └── it should install all packages and set first as root
├── when constructor is called
│   └── it should disable initializers on the implementation
├── when initialize is called with value
│   └── it should accept ETH during initialization
└── when upgradeToAndCall is called with initialization data
    └── it should upgrade and run the callback
